Package: com.gokuencinar.bandlock
Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Analyzer Preview)
Version: 1.6.0~rhui1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental RootHide LTE analyzer preview with modern UI, typed passive LTE monitoring and private local history. Original LTE/NR controls remain unchanged; optional active scan stays strictly gated and can interrupt cellular and emergency service. Not hardware-validated on iOS 18.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Homepage: https://github.com/Gokuencinar/GokuEnREPO/blob/main/tweaks/BandLock/README.md
